# Prisma migrations

- Never `npx prisma db push`.
- Prefer `cd Backend && npm run prisma:migrate` (serialized / `scripts/run-heavy`). Do not hand-write migration SQL when `migrate dev` can generate it.
- Commit `Backend/prisma/migrations/<timestamp>_<name>/migration.sql` with the schema change.
- PostgreSQL `ALTER TYPE ... ADD VALUE` cannot share a transaction with first use of the value — split migrations.
- Details: `docs/ops/development.md`, `docs/architecture/database.md`.
